## Shannon Entropy Calculation

```python
import math
from collections import Counter

def entropy(text):
    freq = Counter(text)
    length = len(text)
    return -sum((c/length) * math.log2(c/length) for c in freq.values())

# Normal subdomain: entropy ~2.5-3.0
# Encoded data: entropy >3.5-4.0
```

