index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4769
  TicketEncryptionType=0x17
  ServiceName!="krbtgt"
| stats count by TargetUserName, IpAddress, ServiceName
| where count > 3
| sort -count
```

### Orphaned TGS (No Prior TGT)
