## Shannon Entropy

Formula: H(X) = -Sum p(x) log2(p(x)). For byte data range is 0.0 to 8.0.

### Python Implementation

```python
import math
from collections import Counter

def shannon_entropy(data):
    freq = Counter(data)
    length = len(data)
    return -sum((c / length) * math.log2(c / length) for c in freq.values())
```

