| Cmdlet | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Confirm-SecureBootUEFI` | Returns `$true` if Secure Boot is enabled. |
| `Get-SecureBootUEFI dbx` | Retrieve the raw dbx variable bytes. |
| `Get-SecureBootUEFI db` | Retrieve the allowed-signatures database. |

## TPM corroboration

| Command | Description |
