## GitHub Actions Workflow Parsing

```python
import yaml

with open(".github/workflows/ci.yml") as f:
    wf = yaml.safe_load(f)

# Key fields
wf["permissions"]           # Workflow-level permissions
wf["jobs"]["build"]["steps"] # Step list
