## YARA Scanning for Remaining Artifacts

### Command
```bash
yara -r rules.yar /target/directory
```

### Rule Example
```yara
rule Malware_Remnant {
    strings:
        $s1 = "malware_mutex" ascii
        $s2 = {4D 5A 90 00}
    condition:
        any of them
}
```
