| Service | Indicator |
|---------|-----------|
| GitHub Pages | 404 "There isn't a GitHub Pages site here" |
| Heroku | "No such app" |
| AWS S3 | "NoSuchBucket" |
| Azure | "404 Web Site not found" |
| Shopify | "Sorry, this shop is currently unavailable" |
