## Workflow 1: Deep Link Assessment
```
[Extract Manifest/Plist] --> [Enumerate schemes] --> [Test each deep link]
                                                          |
                                           +--------------+--------------+
                                           |              |              |
                                    [Parameter injection] [Redirect test] [WebView loading]
